		(property "Description" "Marks a net as an input at a board or sheet boundary. Paired with OUTPUT_FLAG it lets ERC prove direction: a net carrying two OUTPUT_FLAGs is an output driving an output, which is how an uncrossed TX/TX pair is caught. Do not place on a bidirectional net such as SDA."
